<title>HONG KONG: Seaunion interim net back in the black.</title>
<headline>Seaunion interim net back in the black.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	   0.001 gain   vs 0.018 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (U.S. cents)    nil	    vs nil</p>
